e with direct access to the scholarly and archival sources that informed our choices, Charles V|R offers enthusiasts of art, architecture, history, music, religion, and virtual reality as well as students and scholars of those disciplines a multi-modal window into an event of world-historical importance.", "short_description": "Reconstruction of HRE Charles V's 1530 Coronation Mass in Bologna."}]}, "developer_name": "Greenhouse Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://greenhousestudios.uconn.edu/charles-vr-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Greenhouse Studios", "support_website_url": "https://greenhousestudios.uconn.edu/contact-us", "website_url": "https://greenhousestudios.uconn.edu/charlesvr/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28602575622666656"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031632_1894776477716456_2368005796672080765_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQXOVtkekq4Q7kNvwFjb-9s&_nc_oc=Adln_z_T4In2BQn1ajdp8TDiUWDF2_mzNezK06OtofRTPbvrBaEupwuqfraBEs-yBSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftxIQia0axa1E30p0XjkLpe4DlQsmW9KBLlZ3Dqj7ETmA&oe=699C59F6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name